# ── Raw asset sources ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# One folder per character, as it came out of Rodin, AccuRIG or CGTrader: the
# FBX, the texture archives, the ActorCore motion zips. About 1.5 GB in all,
# and `mutantbrain/Textures.rar` alone is 648 MB — GitHub refuses any file
# over 100 MB, so these could not be pushed even if they belonged here.
#
# They do not belong here. What ships is the converted GLB in `public/models`,
# and `tools/fbx-to-creep.mjs` is the recipe that produced it. Keeping the
# sources out is also the rule from docs/HEROES_LECCIONES.md: a problem gets
# fixed at conversion, never at load, so the converter and its options are the
# artefact worth versioning.
#
# Keep your own copies. Re-running the converter needs them, and nothing in
# the repo can replace them.
/bulwark/
/talon/
/oracle/
/vesper/
/erika/
/orc/
/crusader/
/mutantbrain/
/infernaldog/
/export/

# Intermediate conversion output, kept beside the real part files but never
# loaded: the whole prop before it was split and decimated.
public/models/parts/full-raw.glb

# Generated images and one-off GLB exports dropped in the root while working.
/*.glb
/Gemini_Generated_Image_*
/ChatGPT Image*
/image-*.png
/*_Generated_Image_*
bash.exe.stackdump
